{"step_index":343,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-28T20:53:28Z","content":"In `ops/runtime/sovra_multiagent_shm_kernel.cpp`:\nBecause RING_CAPACITY is 16,384 and 22 agents are pushing 50,000 writes each (1,100,000 total writes) without a consumer popping from `read_index`, `write_index - read_index >= RING_CAPACITY` causes high spin-lock yield count!\n\nLet's add a background Consumer Thread in `ops/runtime/sovra_multiagent_shm_kernel.cpp` that pops from `read_index` so the ring buffer flows continuously at full hardware memory bus speed!\n\nLet's edit `ops/runtime/sovra_multiagent_shm_kernel.cpp` using `write_to_file`.","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"/*\\n * SOVRA-NATIVE MULTI-AGENT LOCK-FREE ATOMIC SHM KERNEL & HOSTILE STRESS SUITE v2.0\\n * Includes background consumer thread to drain ring buffer at full hardware speed.\\n */\\n\\n#include <iostream>\\n#include <vector>\\n#include <thread>\\n#include <atomic>\\n#include <chrono>\\n#include <cstring>\\n\\nconstexpr size_t RING_CAPACITY = 65536; // 64k atomic slots\\nconstexpr int AGENT_COUNT = 22;          // The 22-Agent Collective\\nconstexpr int WRITES_PER_AGENT = 50000;   // 1,100,000 total writes\\n\\nstruct AgentMessage {\\n    uint16_t agent_id;\\n    uint64_t sequence_id;\\n    char payload[128];\\n    uint32_t checksum;\\n    std::atomic<bool> ready{false};\\n};\\n\\nstruct LockFreeAtomicRingBuffer {\\n    AgentMessage buffer[RING_CAPACITY];\\n    std::atomic<size_t> write_index{0};\\n    std::atomic<size_t> read_index{0};\\n    std::atomic<uint64_t> total_collisions{0};\\n    std::atomic<uint64_t> total_writes{0};\\n\\n    bool push(uint16_t agent_id, uint64_t seq, const char* data) {\\n        size_t w = write_index.fetch_add(1, std::memory_order_relaxed);\\n        size_t slot = w % RING_CAPACITY;\\n\\n        if (w - read_index.load(std::memory_order_relaxed) >= RING_CAPACITY) {\\n            total_collisions.fetch_add(1, std::memory_order_relaxed);\\n            return false;\\n        }\\n\\n        buffer[slot].agent_id = agent_id;\\n        buffer[slot].sequence_id = seq;\\n        std::strncpy(buffer[slot].payload, data, 128);\\n\\n        uint32_t sum = agent_id + static_cast<uint32_t>(seq);\\n        buffer[slot].checksum = sum;\\n        buffer[slot].ready.store(true, std::memory_order_release);\\n        total_writes.fetch_add(1, std::memory_order_relaxed);\\n        return true;\\n    }\\n\\n    bool pop(AgentMessage& msg) {\\n        size_t r = read_index.load(std::memory_order_relaxed);\\n        if (r >= write_index.load(std::memory_order_relaxed)) {\\n            return false;\\n        }\\n        size_t slot = r % RING_CAPACITY;\\n        if (!buffer[slot].ready.load(std::memory_order_acquire)) {\\n            return false;\\n        }\\\n<truncated 4110 bytes>","Description":"\"Update ops/runtime/sovra_multiagent_shm_kernel.cpp v2.0 with fast atomic consumer loop.\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"/Volumes/Untitled/SSOT_Agentic_Brain_v1.1.0_ENGINEERING_RELEASE/ops/runtime/sovra_multiagent_shm_kernel.cpp\"","toolAction":"\"Updating Multi-Agent C++ SHM Kernel\"","toolSummary":"\"Write ops/runtime/sovra_multiagent_shm_kernel.cpp v2.0\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
